// fused in-kernel stencils: a runtime request, not a guarantee. Only explicit
// local stencils can be inlined into the RHS body -- a compact/matrix engine
// derivative is a banded solve along a whole line -- so the solver degrades to
// the precomputed derivative pass when the engine cannot honour it.
extern bool SMOKEMIN_USE_FUSED_STENCILS;

